00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:28.120
Two suns?!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.140
CHAPTER 53

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:34.130
NARCISSISM OVERLOAD!
NUKE-KUBI'S CLOSE CALL

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:38.130
Tell us why you want to work here.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:44.850
I've done numerous live streams,
which has honed my communication skills.

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:50.060
I'm sure I can put my experience
to good use in a sales job.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.360
I see.

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:54.860
Our company motto is,
"Contributing to society and people".

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.050
What does contribution mean to you?

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:02.410
Contributing to society and people...?

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:07.410
Very well. That's enough.

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:20.900
Huh? You're...

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:25.700
<i>Senpai</i>!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:30.140
So you're finally looking for a job!

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.770
How's it going?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.810
It's fine.

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:40.320
When job hunting, you think, "What a drag!
I wish I'd just get accepted." right?

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:45.390
But the real drag comes
after you actually get a job.

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:50.790
Every day,
riding a packed train to work,

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.340
sucking up to annoying superiors...

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:57.260
And you're struggling just to pay
rent and living expenses.

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:01.300
There's no way to save up,
so I'm worried about after I retire.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.470
Then why are you even working, <i>senpai</i>?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.470
There's other, less restrictive jobs.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:12.730
You mean like that OoTuber stuff
that you do?

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:18.800
No way. Only a chosen few can
make of living off that.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:24.490
I mean, you're job hunting because that's
not enough to make ends meet, right?

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.410
Well...

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:31.370
<i>Today's guest is the super popular
OoTuber, Hikakin-san!</i>

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.080
<i>Boom Boom Hello, Eight TV.</i>

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.420
<i>Hello, I'm Hikakin.</i>

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.630
<i>Will you listen to that crowd!</i>

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.270
<i>Thanks everyone!</i>

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:47.510
Hey, Kitaro! What's the meaning of this?!

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.270
NUKE-KUBI

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.140
Nuke-Kubi, what's wrong?

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.170
YOKAI SPECIAL

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.270
I'm talking about this!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.360
What about this?

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.150
Don't give me that!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.610
It's supposed to be
a special about <i>yokai</i>, but...

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:09.470
it's all about you guys and
there's nothing in it about me!

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:16.750
I bet you paid someone off to have them
write all about you!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.090
Otherwise I'd never get ignored like this!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.970
Why would I ever do that?

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:25.720
What?! Are you trying to play dumb?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.140
Now, now.

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:30.390
I'm sure the only reason
you're not in there

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:35.410
is because you're so famous
there's no need to write about you.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.900
You think so?

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.820
I'm sure of it.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:43.900
There's no point in writing
what everyone knows, is there?

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:48.410
I see! So that's it!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:52.620
Kitaro, you've still got a long way to go.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:54.470
Huh?

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:58.040
Here. You can shake my hand.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:01.130
Everyone wants to shake
a famous <i>yokai</i>'s hand, right?

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:02.210
No thanks.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.130
Here! Come on, be flattered, Kitaro.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.470
You're shaking a famous <i>yokai</i>'s hand.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.910
Well, I'll be going.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.100
Good grief.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:17.690
There's no telling what he'll do if he's
not the center of attention is there?

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:28.200
Hello, hello! It's the Charatomi Channel!

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:32.570
Today's project is
Charatomi's Yokai Walk!

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:38.170
Of course it's not like
I can just find a <i>yokai</i>...

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.230
You called?

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.420
Seriously?!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.110
Are you... a <i>yokai</i>?

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:52.850
I know you're shocked that
a <i>yokai</i> as famous as me showed up.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:53.720
Here.

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:58.230
You wanna shake my hand, right?

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.940
Not really.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:03.440
Wait, are you really such a famous <i>yokai</i>?

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:08.360
Of course. Don't tell me you haven't
heard of the famous Nuke-Kubi-sama.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.130
Nope, I haven't.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:12.870
What?! That's impossible!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.870
NO RESULTS FOR "NUKE-KUBI"

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:19.350
See? Nobody out there knows who you are.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:24.440
That's not possible!

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:34.850
How could nobody know of me?!

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:39.430
There's no <i>yokai</i> stronger
or cooler than me!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:43.480
I'm famous!
I'm not your garden-variety <i>yokai</i>!

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.500
I get it, I get it! Calm down!

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:54.910
You know, I kind of get how you feel.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:08:00.290
I'm not like everybody else either.
I must be one of the chosen.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:02.960
Wanna team up with me?

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:09.150
Let's show the world what I...
what we can do.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:14.390
How have you been recently, Cat-san?

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.160
Same as ever.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.390
And you?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.290
There's nothing out of the ordinary...

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:26.650
Actually, I found this video
and I thought you should see it.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.280
<i>Today, using Nuke-Kubi's power,</i>

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:35.320
<i>we're gonna melt and freeze erasers!</i>

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.320
<i>Let's watch!</i>

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.240
<i>He's starting...</i>

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.000
<i>What heat! They melted!</i>

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:46.730
<i>Now it's cold!</i>

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.330
<i>They're frozen solid!</i>

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.220
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:54.130
Him again! And with Nuke-Kubi!

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:57.890
He's called Nuke-Kubi?
What sort of <i>yokai</i> is he?

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:03.100
He gives off extreme heat from his head,

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.950
and extreme cold from his body.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:12.130
When connected, they cancel each other out
and maintain a normal temperature, but...

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:13.860
But...?

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:20.000
<i>Hello, hello!
It's Charatomi Channel's Charatomi and...</i>

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.620
<i>Nuke-Kubi!</i>

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.210
<i>Today's subject is this!</i>

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:26.370
<i>An alarm clock!</i>

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:28.710
Well? Can he really melt this?

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.130
He did!

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:32.280
Delicious!

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:35.260
Whoa! It really melted!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.340
SUBSCRIBERS

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:52.480
Excuse me. Are you Charatomi-san
and Nuke-Kubi-san?

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.410
That's right!

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.160
We always watch your videos! We're fans!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.710
Thanks! How nice!

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:05.640
Please shake our hands!

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.650
Sure!

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:14.150
We're so lucky!

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:18.180
Young girls asking to shake my hand...

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:20.850
This is proof I'm a famous <i>yokai</i>!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:25.390
I've become a genuine, real famous <i>yokai</i>!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:28.230
This is nothing.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.400
Okay, let's go record.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.690
Right now?

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:35.610
Yeah. I told you we'd record
at least one video a day.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:39.450
You've gotta upload every day
if you want more views.

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:43.370
But I'm famous enough now.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.080
I've got people asking to shake my hand.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:50.170
Besides, doing this every day is
tiring me out.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.710
What are you talking about?!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:54.970
Having people ask to shake your hand
isn't worth anything!

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:57.210
We're barely on a roll now.

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:00.720
I've got to become
a top class Japanese OoTuber

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:04.970
and make enough ad revenue
that I can live off of.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.310
Otherwise I'll need to find a job!

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:10.900
Humans make no sense.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:13.150
Regardless, I'm taking a break.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.530
Let me get some shut-eye for once.

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:16.610
Hey, wait!

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:19.050
Good night.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.300
Oh come on...

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:36.130
Crap! I've got an interview today!

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:44.280
Seriously, who schedules
an interview at rush hour?!

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:47.100
Hey, watch it!

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:55.750
<i>What is that?
Is that the face of a living person?</i>

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:59.650
<i>That person... and that one...</i>

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.530
<i>They're all the same.</i>

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.780
The doors are closing!

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:14.900
<i>T-To be one of these side characters?</i>

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.760
<i>To be a cog of society?</i>

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:19.170
<i>Me?</i>

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.180
<i>No! I'm the main character!</i>

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:24.320
<i>Even if everyone else is a side character,
I'm the main character!</i>

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:28.450
<i>I'm not going to be like
one of these guys!</i>

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.550
What a nice sleep.

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:48.600
My body's missing!

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:53.830
It's hot.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:57.550
I don't feel like eating ramen
when it's this hot.

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:59.920
Really? I'm fine.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.840
Well I'm not.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:06.840
How come it's this hot
when it's not even summer!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.240
What's that?

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.350
Two suns?!

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:14.600
No, that's Nuke-Kubi!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:22.990
Oh no! Separated from his body,
Nuke-Kubi is getting hotter and bigger!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:25.740
In the end, he'll explode!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.740
If that happens, it'll be a catastrophe!

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.660
NUKE-KUBI

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:40.170
NUKE-KUBI ON A WALK

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:39.060
-<i>"Ge."</i>
-<i>"Ge."</i>

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.070
<i>"Ge."</i>

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.170
I can't...

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.170
So hot...

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:49.180
<i>Everyone, please remain calm.</i>

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:54.390
<i>Currently, a second sun has
appeared in Japan, causing extreme heat.</i>

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.190
<i>Fires have broken out all over.</i>

00:13:57.190 --> 00:14:00.940
<i>The Ministry of the Environment is
investigating...</i>

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.430
<i>Cat-san! Look at this!</i>

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:12.290
<i>Hello, hello! It's the Charatomi Channel!</i>

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:15.790
<i>Is everyone enjoying my surprise game?</i>

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:21.920
<i>The one causing this abnormal weather
is none other than me, Charatomi!</i>

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.800
<i>There's only one way to restore peace!</i>

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:29.600
<i>The treasure Game Master Charatomi
has hidden... is Nuke-Kubi's body!</i>

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:34.060
<i>Finding it is the mission
for you side characters!</i>

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:36.890
<i>Oh, don't forget to subscribe!</i>

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.640
This guy...!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.690
Did you see the Charatomi Channel?

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.240
We have to find Nuke-Kubi's body.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.450
But, is it true?

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:46.530
Just stop Charatomi.

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:49.620
I'm the main character after all!

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:52.080
I've got a huge burst of subscribers!

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:55.450
Now I'm one of the top OoTubers!

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:56.680
<i>"You scum."</i>

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:59.850
Look at all those comments!
I'm so popular!

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:58.190
<i>"Get real!"</i>

00:14:58.310 --> 00:14:59.100
<i>"I'll get you."</i>

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.750
I can't hold on!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.210
Charatomi!

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:09.170
You two.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.430
Why you...!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:14.430
Hold on. It's okay, I get it.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.890
You're here for my autograph, right?

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:20.310
An autograph pad? Your back?
Where do you want it?

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:26.420
It'll sell for a lot. I'm the biggest
OoTuber in the world after all!

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.490
Stop playing around!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:30.700
Where's Nuke-Kubi's body?

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:35.330
Come on. Asking me is against the rules.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.290
Get with the program.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.950
Why are you doing this?!

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:43.250
Because I wanna be famous of course.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.800
You're really hopeless.

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:48.340
Even if you get famous for this,
you'll only be hated.

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:54.030
You know you'll never become a popular
OoTuber, don't you?

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:57.370
You're scolding me?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:02.100
What do <i>yokai</i> like you know about me?!

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:03.610
Even if I work,

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:08.980
without having a famous university degree,
I can tell I won't make enough to save up.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:13.740
Yet, I'm supposed to ride crammed trains
and be a slave to superiors every day,

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.950
get scolded at work dinners
and have no free time?!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.910
Can you even call that living?!

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.120
Even so...!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.370
I'm... I'm supposed to be
one of the chosen!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.750
I won't be some washed up adult.

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:30.380
If I can become a more famous OoTuber than
anyone, I can live the easy life!

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:33.820
That's how I'm supposed to live!

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:37.140
Hello?

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:41.830
<i>Cat-san, I think I know
where Nuke-Kubi's body is!</i>

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.900
Remember what you told me?

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.730
Nuke-Kubi's head gives off heat
and his body gives off cold.

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:55.200
I figured wherever his body is
would be colder.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:59.740
I checked with an app and
there's one place that's really cold.

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.370
I'll send a map now.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.460
Got it. Thanks.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:07.310
Let's go.
There's no point talking to this guy.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:09.500
Wait!

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:16.760
I won't... I won't let my game end yet.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.140
I need to get more subscribers...!

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:26.600
Dammit! It's so hot!

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.150
Are you okay?

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.760
It should be somewhere around here.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.660
Kitaro, there!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:42.270
This is...!

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:49.690
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.630
Found it!

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.140
Are you okay?

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:10.820
<i>Hikakin?</i>

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:12.610
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:15.920
Why don't we go over there?

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.920
What the hell is this?

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:30.880
With this weather,
I rented every snow machine I could.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.110
It makes it pretty cool.

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:35.530
<i>It's cool...</i>

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:37.920
What the...?!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.300
Hikakin!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:40.930
Hikakin, over here!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.160
Let's play!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.830
Wanna have a survival snowball fight?

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:50.860
Hikakin, Hikakin!

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:51.860
Let's play!

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:53.340
Why?

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:56.840
I'm the one who set up this game.

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:58.990
I'm the main character!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:01.780
Why are you acting like
you're the main character!

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:07.660
I'm just putting my all into
doing what I enjoy.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:11.920
Putting everything into enjoying something
isn't as easy as it looks, though.

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:20.720
But, I think when people do that, they
finally become their own main characters.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:32.480
It's all over!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.690
Nuke-Kubi, we've brought your body!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:36.980
Kitaro!

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:40.490
There!

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:53.150
Nuke-Kubi, are you okay?

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:56.800
Th-Thank goodness...

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:58.800
The temperature's back!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.490
Thank goodness!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.210
Do you think you're
getting away with this?

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.690
Maybe a little pain will
keep you from doing it again.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:22.490
That man's words made me see the truth.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.450
I'm not the main character at all.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:28.960
I only care what people think
and can't find what I really love.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.930
I'm a pathetic loser.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.960
No one starts out finding what they love.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:41.430
As you struggle to find
your place in this world,

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:46.770
eventually you'll come to understand
what you love.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.850
Do you think so?

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.500
Yes. You'll be fine.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:54.060
Thank you.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.520
I want to try.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:00.280
Anything...
I want to actually try hard at something.

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:05.160
Maybe then I can at least be
my own main character.

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:09.120
Try not to cause trouble
for people this time.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.750
Thank you very much!

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:19.250
Hurry and serve the food!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.340
Yes, sir!

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:22.470
Here's your food!

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:24.180
Cold <i>sake</i>?

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.220
Right away!

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:27.090
Welcome!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:32.220
Here, <i>senpai</i>. This one's on me.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:36.230
There's something different about you.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.230
Huh? Really?

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:41.730
You've got
a gleam in your eye or something.

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:49.680
You put us all through hell,
but it looks like you've finally woken up.

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:51.790
I better keep up.

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:53.870
Let's both do our best.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>You're a dream
My dream</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>kimi wa yume boku no yume</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>I'm dreaming in a dream</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>yume no naka de yume miteiru</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>Let's stay like this forever</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>itsumade mo kono mama de imashou</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>You blur and begin to fade</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>kasuka kimi ga nijimu</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry
Where did you come from?</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry anata wa doko kara kitano?</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>A masquerade
Faceless faces laugh</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>kamenbutou kao no nai kao ga warau</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>Hee-hee-hee</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>fufufu</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>In dreams, in dreams
Lost in dreams</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>yume ni yume ni yume ni samayoi</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>Twirling around</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>kuru kuru to mawaru</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>Everyone dancing, dancing
Looking for love</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>dare mo odoru odoru ai wo sagashite</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO, spin, spin
Dream, dream</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO mawareyo maware yume yume</i>

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:04.880
<i>Humans and </i>yokai<i> fighting over land.</i>

00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:07.420
<i>Dad, what comes from that is...</i>

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:09.890
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:10.010 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>DOROTABO, LIFE AND EARTH</i>

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:15.100
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
